---
name: partner-radar
description: Reads industry news continuously and judges every item with an LLM against one thesis, sorting companies into PARTNER / ABSORB / WATCH / INTEL. Use when asked to find partners, suppliers, or competitors, or to run the partner-radar pipeline.
